GridCraft loads recipes from JSON files in:
for server: mods/GreatDani_GridCraft/Recipes/
for world: AppData\Roaming\Hytale\UserData\Saves\<your world>\mods\GreatDani_GridCraft\Recipes

Each file can contain either:
A single recipe object, or
An array of recipe objects (multiple recipes in one file)

Recipe object fields
pattern (required)

A 3-row crafting pattern (strings). Spaces mean “empty”.

"pattern": [
  "PPP",
  " S ",
  " S "
]

key (required)

Maps characters used in pattern to ingredients.

Each key entry can be written in 3 ways:

Item id and ReouseTypeID:
"P": "Wood_Trunk" 

Item with quantity:
"S": { "item": "Wood_Oak_Trunk", "quantity": 2 }

Resource type with quantity:
"W": { "resourcetype": "Wood_Trunk", "quantity": 1 }

result (required)
Output item and quantity:
"result": { "item": "Tool_Pickaxe_Crude", "quantity": 1 }

Example: single recipe file
{
  "pattern": [
    "   ",
    "PS ",
    " W "
  ],
  "key": {
    "P": "Wood_Trunk",
    "S": { "item": "Wood_Oak_Trunk", "quantity": 2 },
    "W": { "resourcetype": "Wood_Trunk", "quantity": 1 }
  },
  "result": {
    "item": "Wood_Bamboo_Trunk",
    "quantity": 10
  }
}

Example: multiple recipes in one file
[
  {
    "pattern": [
      "PPP",
      " S ",
      " S "
    ],
    "key": {
      "P": "Wood_Trunk",
      "S": "Ingredient_Stick"
    },
    "result": {
      "item": "Tool_Pickaxe_Crude",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "pattern": [
      " P ",
      "   ",
      "   "
    ],
    "key": {
      "P": { "resourcetype": "Wood_Trunk", "quantity": 2 }
    },
    "result": {
      "item": "Wood_Bamboo_Trunk_Deco",
      "quantity": 5
    }
  }
]
